# Security Rules

- Never trust `userId`, `role`, subscription status, or payment status from query params or request body.
- Every financial endpoint requires authenticated user ownership check.
- Use httpOnly session cookies; no JWT in localStorage.
- Rate-limit auth and payment endpoints.
- Hash passwords with bcrypt (cost 12).
- Admin routes require `role === SUPER_ADMIN` via `requireSuperAdmin()`.
- Audit log all payment approvals/rejections and transaction deletions.
- Use Helmet, CORS restricted to web origin, input validation on all endpoints.
- SUPER_ADMIN must only be created via controlled seed/setup — never via public registration.
